        {
            "type": "Label",
            "caption": "One row per device. A device announces itself once per system it belongs to; the columns \"Symcon\", \"A\", \"B\" … show which systems it is in — Symcon is this installation, the others are listed above with their ID. Thread devices are announced by a border router on their behalf, LAN/WLAN devices by themselves.",
            "italic": true
        }
    ],
